WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
It's an amazing moment to be there.

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.400
If you don't have any team, you can join us!

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.600
We can have fun.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:07.600
Welcome in!

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:19.170
I will contact you soon for another 100%.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:24.370
The European Championships, it's been an awesome experience, beating people from all over.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:29.770
I strongly urge everyone that wants to and can play abroad to do so.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:30.770
Met great people.

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:32.730
We got a lot of great friends coming together,

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.730
making friends all over the world.

00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:35.970
Shout out to The Leftovers.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:36.930
Are you hungry?

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:39.370
I'm ready to eat, baby.
